> Java arrays should already be converted to the equivalent Godot arrays; is that not working for you?

@m4gr3d last I checked on 4.5 java arrays of java objects were `JavaObject` in GDScript if I'm not mistaken. Didn't test on 4.6 if that was changed recently. I remember indexers like `array[i]` not working from GDScript and thinking "well if works like that it's better to use a list, because at least I can `list.call(&'get', i)`"
But I'd have to test again later to be sure.
